* {{I|Mysterious Liquid}}: The charged sword attack spawns creep, the projectiles do not / {{dlc_|r+}} projectiles spawn creep as well.
* {{I|Parasitoid}}: The sword projectiles can still spawn flies and spiders, but the swings themselves won't / {{dlc|r+}} the swings can now leave slowing creep and spawn flies and spiders.
* {{I|Playdough Cookie}}: Every sword swing gains a different color and effect based on that color.
* {{I|Pupula Duplex}}: No effect.
* {{i|Sinus Infection}}: The sword swing has a chance to stick boogers to enemies it hits. The beam can stick to enemies.
* {{I|Sulfur}}: Overridden by Spirit Sword. Damage up on second and subsequent uses while in the same room still applies.
* {{c|Tainted Forgotten}}: No effect.
* {{I|Tech.5}}: Fires as normal while charging and swinging the sword.
* {{i|Technology Zero}}: Sword shots are connected with electricity, swings are unaffected.
* {{i|Terra}}/{{i|Sulfuric Acid}}: Only the sword's beams can destroy rocks.

